MORET_BEGIN
GODIVA VARD sans compte
* Hypothese : H33b skills v0.2 : VARD v(1)..v(n) sans compte ; densite +1 pct / -1 pct
* Attendu    : NORMAL END, dkeff_1 proche de ok_pert_dens_repl (+8.26E-03)

GEOM
  MODU 0
    TYPE 1 SPHE 8.7407
    VOLU 1 0 1 m1 0. 0. 0.
  ENDM
ENDG

MATE
  CONT
    LIBR jeff311.xml
    TEMP 300
    COMP UMET
      CONC
        U234 4.91895E-04
        U235 4.49988E-02
        U238 2.49865E-03
    ENDC
  ENDM

ASSO
  MEDI m1 UMET
    VARD 0.01 -0.01
ENDA

SOUR
  UNIF 1000
ENDS

TERM
  CYCL PASS 30 ACTI 100
ENDT

ENDD
MORET_END
